# Shared by every scene: sourced right after its Output.
Set Shell zsh
Set FontFamily "JetBrainsMono Nerd Font Mono"
Set FontSize 18
Set Width 1200
Set Height 640
Set Padding 28
Set Theme "Catppuccin Mocha"
Set WindowBar Colorful
Set BorderRadius 10
Set Margin 24
Set MarginFill "#11111b"
Set TypingSpeed 45ms
Set CursorBlink false

Hide
Type "source ~/.zshrc && cd ~/calc && clear"
Enter
Sleep 700ms
Show
